DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T130000
DTSTAMP:20260729T220005Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901301371546-52901301373597@local-events
DESCRIPTION:A balanced gut is crucial for our mental\, physical\, and emot
 ional health. However\, poor eating habits\, chronic dieting\, and our str
 essful lifestyles can leave our gut unbalanced and unwell.\n\nIn this webi
 nar\, you’ll learn how you can support your gut and improve your overall
  health. We’ll explore the interaction between the nervous system in the
  gut and central nervous system and the importance of the microbiome. Our 
 main focus will be practical tips - integrative strategies to support your
  gut h\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/class
 es/register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=125
