UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901301477030-52901301478057@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Each of us has a natural biological rhythm\, known as a chrono
 type\, that influences when we feel alert\, when we feel sleepy\, and when
  we do our best thinking. Trying to force ourselves into a lifestyle that 
 is out of alignment with our chronotype can contribute to stress\, sleep i
 ssues\, and low productivity.\n\nIn this engaging\, evidence-based webinar
